Yes. Just *don't* hit Norn! At least not before finishing the quest.
Killing peaceful creatures lowers your alignment, and if you kill *all* of
the peacefuls on Home 1, it might temporarily lower your alignment too
much for Norn to let you further on the quest. In that case, go to the
main dungeon to kill some hostiles until you're pious again.

Generally speaking, any valkyrie at explevel 14 is ready for the Quest.
At least if she has some way to levitate, that may be necessary on the
quest end level.

